 "etapas": [
  {
   "etapa": "explicar",
   "piezas": [
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "At the hotel",
     "texto": [
      "**방을 예약했어요** = I've booked a room.",
      "At reception they will ask you for your passport: **여권 좀 보여 주세요**.",
      "**아침 식사** = breakfast (식사 means «meal» in the sense of breakfast, lunch or dinner).",
      "**방은 오 층에 있어요** = the room is on the fifth floor."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "If you don't feel well",
     "texto": [
      "**아파요** = it hurts; I'm ill. What hurts takes 이/가: **머리가 아파요** (my head hurts), **배가 아파요** (my stomach hurts), **목이 아파요** (my throat hurts).",
      "**어디가 아파요?** = What hurts? («where does it hurt?»).",
      "**열이 있어요** = I have a fever. **감기에 걸렸어요** = I've got a cold.",
      "Medicines are «eaten»: **약을 먹어요** = I take medicine. The pharmacy is **약국**.",
      "To someone who is ill you say **푹 쉬세요** (rest well)."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Because…: -아서 / -어서",
     "texto": [
      "To give the reason within the same sentence, remove 요 from the present and add **서**.",
      "아파요 → **아파서**. **아파서** 학교에 못 가요 = because I'm ill, I can't go to school.",
      "The cause comes first and the result after."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    }
   ]
  },
